<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:40 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>美国的在线社区和联系</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/internet/2026/10/14/online-community-and-connection-in-america/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PI_2026.10.14_online-communities_Feature_Chart-art.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;近十分之四的美国成年人都在在线社​​区中。这些虚拟的第三空间可以采取多种形式，例如 Facebook 群组、在线视频游戏或 Reddit 上的粉丝论坛。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/internet/2026/10/14/online-community-and-connection-in-america/</guid></item><item><title>许多美国人正在努力买得起基本必需品</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/14/many-americans-are-struggling-to-afford-basic-necessities/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.14_Personal-Finance_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;去年，44% 的美国人难以支付基本必需品，其中低收入成年人受到的打击最为严重。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/14/many-americans-are-struggling-to-afford-basic-necessities/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对经济不平等的看法、原因以及谁应该解决这个问题</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/social-trends/2026/10/14/americans-views-of-economic-inequality-its-causes-and-who-should-fix-it/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/ST_26.10.14_EconomicAttitudes_featured@2x.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;自 2019 年以来，越来越多的人认为不平等现象严重，认为需要彻底重建经济体系才能解决这一问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/social-trends/2026/10/14/americans-views-of-economic-inequality-its-causes-and-who-should-fix-it/</guid></item><item><title>宗教团体对 2026 年中期选举的偏好差异很大</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/13/religious-groups-differ-widely-in-their-2026-midterm-preferences/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.13_voting-religion_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;白人福音派新教徒和白人天主教徒在中期选举中支持共和党，而其他宗教团体则分裂或倾向于民主党。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:28:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/13/religious-groups-differ-widely-in-their-2026-midterm-preferences/</guid></item><item><title>为什么有些人不使用聊天机器人？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/09/why-dont-some-people-use-chatbots/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.09_Chatbots_feature.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;大约一半的美国成年人从不使用聊天机器人，大多数非用户都表示不感兴趣、担心隐私或准确性问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:30:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/09/why-dont-some-people-use-chatbots/</guid></item></channel></rss>